#: src/postulo/templates/resume/europass_import.html:22
#, draft
msgid ""
"Choose the PDF you downloaded from europass.europa.eu, as it is: the CV is attached inside it, and that is what Postulo reads. Older Europass files read too: the XML and PDF of the editor before 2020, and the JSON of its web service. Postulo works out which it is, shows you what is in it, and writes nothing until you say so."
msgstr ""
"Vyberte PDF stažené z europass.europa.eu tak, jak je: životopis je přiložen uvnitř a to Postulo čte. Čtou se i starší soubory Europass: XML a PDF editoru před rokem 2020 a JSON jeho webové služby. Postulo samo pozná, o který jde, ukáže vám, co obsahuje, a nic nezapíše, dokud nepovolíte."

